      "message": "service objects (e.g., showClientService) are allocated on the stack. Since server_-\u003eWait() blocks, this is technically safe for now, but if the server were to shut down and return, those objects are destroyed before server_ is necessarily cleared. Move these to be class members or std::shared_ptr",
